  "prefLabel": "Vet 103.01 Composition of the Board",
  "priorExpiration": "1997-06-08",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Vet 103.01 Composition of the Board. Pursuant to RSA 332-B:3, I, the board shall consist of 7 members who meet the eligibility requirements of RSA 332-B:3, I and II. The board shall consist of 5 practicing licensed veterinarians, one representative of the general public unconnected with the veterinary profession, and the state veterinarian.\n\nSource. #5024, eff 12-4-90; ss by #6450, INTERIM, eff 2-8-97, EXPIRES: 6-8-97; ss by #6480, eff 3-29-97; ss by #7417, eff 12-21-00; ss by #9386, eff 2-11-09; ss by #13269, eff 9-29-21; ss by #14627, eff 7-1-26",
